  "description": "The data catalogue of the North Pacific Marine Science Organization (PICES): descriptive metadata records for datasets and reports produced by PICES expert groups and their member-country partners, migrated from the former PICES FGDC metadata catalogue. The catalogue is hosted as a community on Zenodo, which stores the records and mints their DOIs; this JSON-LD description is published by PICES for the IOC Ocean Data and Information System (ODIS).\n\nZenodo community description: The official data catalogue for data produced by PICES expert groups.",
